 LCD: Thiết kế đẹp với màn LCD, bơm Asetek Gen7 v2 đáp ứng khả năng tản nhiệt cho các chip xịn hiệu năng cao\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>VIETNAM</span> <span>07/29/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX LC III 360 ARGB LCD Media review Award of Congngheviet Gold Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://congngheviet.com/tren-tay-tan-nhiet-aio-asus-rog-strix-lc-iii-360-argb-lcd/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/201911281814123100179.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"4 stars out of 5\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      GinjFo\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>4 stars out of 5</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      With the ROG Strix LC III 360 aRGB LCD, Asus offers a top-of-the-range watercooling system featuring an LCD screen. It features customizable animations and real-time monitoring of certain critical parameters. In use, we find solid cooling performance…\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>06/28/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX LC III 360 ARGB LCD Media review Award of 4 stars out of 5\" tabindex=\"0\" href=