wardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1350/201911191849478810279.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Best Performance\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      www.vmodtech.com\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Best Performance</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ROG Strix LC III 360 ARGB LCD features a sleek black design with customizable ARGB lighting. Its cooling performance is impressive, handling Hi-End CPUs with ease, with idle temps at 32-35°C and full load at 66-69°C for 15 minutes. It's extremely quiet, supports the latest AMD and Intel platforms, including LGA 1851, and is controlled via Armoury Crate. Priced around 7,000-8,000 THB with a 6-year warranty.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>THAILAND</span> <span>09/26/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX LC III 360 ARGB LCD Media review Award of Best Performance\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.vmodtech.com/th/article/rog-strix-lc-iii-360-argb-lcd-cpu-liquid-cooler-review\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1252/202010232220041520254.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"DDworld recommended\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Ddworld\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>DDworld recommended</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      ROG Strix LC III 360 ARGB is therefore not impressive in terms of price, but it is a good, very functional standard powerful AiO with a long 6-year warranty. So we can definitely recommend them.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>07/19/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX LC III 360 ARGB LCD Media review Award of DDworld recommended\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"http://www.ddworld.cz/pc-a-komponenty/procesory-a-pameti/asus-rog-strix-lc-iii-360-argb-lcd-test-a-recenze-nove-generaci-vykonnych-aio-chladicu-4.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <!----></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-video\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Video_review\" class=\"ProductAwardVideo__productAwardPagePadding__Z+Cw7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__line__wNtmI\" style=\"display:;\"></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoWrapper__-NXix\"><div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoReviewTitle__0lBVH\" style=\"display:;\"><h2 class=\"pageVideo vnRogFont ProductAwardVideo__vnRogFontSize__n4Ouu\">Video review</h2> <span style=\"display:;\">(13)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoContentScroll__+rpKV\"><ul class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoContainer__SWxvv\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ActionVideo