2 32\" svg-inline role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2.24 12a14.32 14.32 0 0127.52 0h1.74a16 16 0 00-31 0zm27.52 8a14.32 14.32 0 01-27.52 0H.5a16 16 0 0031 0z\"></path></svg></button> <div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"We tested the Asus ROG Strix LC III 360 ARGB LCD for you.\nStyle, a beautiful screen, and performance? \" class=\"ActionVideo__videoImage__MDnor\" style=\"background-image:url(https://img.youtube.com/vi/mqjS55rBwiw/hqdefault.jpg);\"></div> <!----> <!----> <div class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionsItemContent__b+fib AwardVideoContent__reviewType__isoMH\"><p class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionTitle__9KMXz\">We tested the Asus ROG Strix LC III 360 ARGB LCD for you.\nStyle, a beautiful screen, and performance? </p></div></li></ul></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoMoreButton__h9Vas\"><div class=\"seeAllButton__seeAllButton__dIrKX seeAllButton__visible__OJDnB\"><button tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Xem tất cả Video review\" class=\"robotoFont seeAllButton__text__TNQDv\"><span>\n      Xem tất cả\n    </span> <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" svg-inline alt role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M6 9.55l-5-5V2.5l5 5 5-5v2.05l-5 5z\" fill=\"#181818\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-media\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Media_review\"><div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__productAwardPagePadding__LFeX-\"><div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__line__Z71fT\" style=\"display:;\"></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__awardMediaTitle__t55HQ\"><h2 class=\"pageMedia vnRogFont ProductAwardMedia__vnRogFontSize__ARdRa\">\n        Media review\n      </h2> <span style=\"display:;\">(4)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__mobileMediaContent__C6DyG\"><ul class=\"ProductAwardMedia__awardMediaContainer__M6cwI\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Toms Hardware Italy\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1281/202208031428531890878.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      ASUS TUF Gaming BTF components wink at users who want a clean and neat look that is not marred by visible cables. At the moment it is undoubtedly a niche solution, but it could easily turn out to be the next trend in the PC world, especially if more and more components of this type arrive at increasingly competitive prices as time goes on.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Toms Hardware Italy\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>ITALY</span> <span>05/20/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX LC III 360 ARGB LCD media of Toms Hardware Italy\" href=\"https://www.tomshw.it/hardware/asus-back-to-future-come-un-pc-senza-cavi-test-recensione\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Overclockers.ua\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1353/202010262126295620585.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      The ROG STRIX LC III 360 ARGB LCD liquid cooling system from ASUS has demonstrated a decent level of performance and heat dissipation efficiency, making it a great choice for enthusiasts and gamers.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Overclockers.ua\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>UKRAINE</span> <span>07/17/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX LC III 360 ARGB LCD media of Overclockers.ua\" href=\"https://www.overclockers.ua/ua/cooler/asus-rog-strix-lc-III-360-argb-lcd/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"GameGPU\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1353/202303301500435320523.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      With such a CVO, even with high CPU and memory overclocking, the temperature did not exceed 75°C in stressful scenarios, allowing the platform to unleash its potential without the risk of trotting.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      GameGPU\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>UKRAINE</span> <span>01/13/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX LC III 360 ARGB LCD media of GameGPU\" href=\"https://uk.gamegpu.com/%D0%BC%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%81%D1%8C%D0%BA%D1%96-%D0%BF%D0%BB%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B8/obzor-asus-rog-strix-b860-f-gaming-wifi\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Hardware &amp; Co\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/202303302142500270435.jpg);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      The ROG finish adds a touch of class to the whole package [...]. In terms of performance, the ROG Strix LC III 360 ARGB LCD proved particularly comfortable in all the tests we put it through. Ultimately, the ROG Strix LC III 360 ARGB LCD kit is clean, neat, well-equipped...\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Hardware &amp; Co\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>08/05/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX LC III 360 ARGB LCD media of Hardware &amp; Co\" href=\"https://hardwareand.co/dossiers/refroidissement/asus-rog-strix-lc-iii-360-argb-lcd-en-test\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__rewardMoreButton__7-dJ4\" style=\"display:none;\"><div class=\"seeAllButton__seeAllButton__dIrKX seeAllButton__visible__OJDnB\"><button tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Xem tất cả Media review\" class=\"robotoFont seeAllButton__text__TNQDv\"><span>\n      Xem tất cả\n    </span> <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" svg-inline alt role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M6 9.55l-5-5V2.5l5 5 5-5v2.05l-5 5z\" fill=\"#181818\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div> <script type=\"application/javascript\" src=\"https://rog.asus.com/rog/nuxtStatic/js/overview.js\"></script> <!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div> <!----> <!----></div></main>"}